    "會把 $\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+q}$ 拆成「$\\ln$ 的部分」與「$\\arctan$ 的部分」",
    "分母是 $x^2+px+q$ 時，會配方，並把分子湊成分母的導數加一個常數"
  ],
  "visual": null,
  "concept": [
    {
      "heading": "① 拆不開的二次式",
      "body": [
        "$x^2-1=(x-1)(x+1)$，但 $x^2+1$ 呢？",
        "$x^2+1=0$ 沒有實根，拆不成實係數的一次因式",
        "用判別式判斷："
      ],
      "tex": [
        "x^2+px+q\\ \\text{不可約}\\iff p^2-4q<0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "① 不可約的那一項怎麼設",
      "body": [
        "分子比分母低一次：一次式 $Bx+C$",
        "只設常數 $\\frac{C}{x^2+1}$ 會不夠：例如 $\\frac{x}{x^2+1}$ 就湊不出來",
        "例：$\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{x+2}{x(x^2+1)}\\,dx$",
        "去分母：",
        "• 代 $x=0$：$2=A$",
        "• 比 $x^2$：$0=A+B$，$B=-2$",
        "• 比 $x$：$1=C$",
        "驗算 $x=1$：左邊 $\\frac32$，右邊 $2+\\frac{-1}{2}=\\frac32$"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+px+q}",
        "\\frac{x+2}{x(x^2+1)}=\\frac{A}{x}+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+1}",
        "x+2=A(x^2+1)+(Bx+C)x",
        "\\frac{x+2}{x(x^2+1)}=\\frac2x+\\frac{-2x+1}{x^2+1}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "② $\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+a^2}$ 拆成兩塊",
      "body": [
        "有 $x$ 的：$u=x^2+a^2$，$du=2x\\,dx$",
        "$x^2+a^2>0$，所以 $\\ln$ 裡不用絕對值",
        "常數的：基本積分表",
        "令 $x=au$：$\\int\\frac{a\\,du}{a^2(u^2+1)}=\\frac1a\\arctan u$",
        "回到 ① 那一題："
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+a^2}=B\\cdot\\frac{x}{x^2+a^2}+C\\cdot\\frac{1}{x^2+a^2}",
        "\\int\\frac{x}{x^2+a^2}\\,dx=\\frac12\\ln(x^2+a^2)+C",
        "\\int\\frac{1}{x^2+a^2}\\,dx=\\frac1a\\arctan\\frac xa+C",
        "\\int\\frac{-2x+1}{x^2+1}\\,dx=-\\ln(x^2+1)+\\arctan x",
        "\\begin{aligned}&\\int\\frac{x+2}{x(x^2+1)}\\,dx\\\\&=2\\ln|x|-\\ln(x^2+1)+\\arctan x+C\\end{aligned}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ 分母是 $x^2+px+q$：先配方",
      "body": [
        "判別式 $4-20<0$：不可約，不能再拆",
        "分母的導數是 $2x+2$：分子湊導數",
        "導數那塊：$u=x^2+2x+5$",
        "$x^2+2x+5=(x+1)^2+4>0$，不用絕對值",
        "常數那塊：配方"
      ],
      "tex": [
        "\\int\\frac{2x+5}{x^2+2x+5}\\,dx",
        "2x+5=(2x+2)+3",
        "\\int\\frac{2x+2}{x^2+2x+5}\\,dx=\\ln(x^2+2x+5)",
        "x^2+2x+5=(x+1)^2+4",
        "\\int\\frac{3}{(x+1)^2+2^2}\\,dx=\\frac32\\arctan\\frac{x+1}{2}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ 合起來",
